  "description": "A list of Inventory types used to classify Emission Activities. Available options are Source, Sink, or\nCredit.\n\nSource and Sink are defined in ISO 14064-1. As an example, Sinks can be further broken down into\nEmission Category Types (operation versus value chain), Emission Scope Type (technology versus\nnature), activity categories (technology group), and activity types (specific technologies); for example,\nemission storage capacity such as CO subsurface reservoirs, can be defined as a specific activity type.\n2",
